1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,451
My pizza sued me.

2
00:00:01,571 --> 00:00:03,021
You ate my dad.

3
00:00:03,141 --> 00:00:05,147
Exhibit A. My dinner plate.

4
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:07,272
I licked off the fingerprints.

5
00:00:07,392 --> 00:00:09,632
I demanded a jury of my peers.

6
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:11,651
Twelve garlic knots stood up.

7
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:13,947
Tough room. I had garlic breath.

8
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:15,240
Thirty minutes in the oven!

9
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,513
Wait. The timer says thirty-one.

10
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:19,211
Their box had a guarantee.

11
00:00:19,331 --> 00:00:21,379
Thirty minutes or I go free.

12
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:22,861
Case dismissed.

13
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:24,837
I celebrated with a breadstick.

14
00:00:25,917 --> 00:00:27,538
It already had a lawyer.
